From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:34:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: qualcomm: ppe: program flow priority across QoS bands

Accept flow priority actions and program them into PPE flow entries.
Map the eight Linux priorities across the three available hardware QoS
bands, keeping action acceptance and its hardware effect together.

Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
